From 6e0aebf677737cc31b9b7a016e47095c56cb24ba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andreas Baierl <ichgeh@imkreisrum.de>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 09:01:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 25/34] Add setup entries for resolution, scaling and frame
 rate

The browser resolution and frame rate could only be set on its
command line, the scaling by the output device only with -f. Make them
setup entries and send resolution and frame rate to the browser. The
setup page moves into its own file.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5
